      "content": "it's just such a weird sensation, like it’s literally tearing inside. but honestly i feel okay otherwise, no dizziness or anything, just this localized pain. i'll probably just stick to the 800mg every 6 hours so i can get through work tomorrow. you think it's safe to just keep doing that for a few days until it settles down? i'd rather not go to the hospital if there's no real reason to.",
